{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1429319552#4_3022862229","relevance":3,"reason":"This is part of the exact Zocdoc answer about WBC over 15000 and directly advises contacting a doctor because unresolved symptoms could indicate something more serious, with emergency/medical-advice caveats and treatment-change warnings.","learned":"For WBC over 15,000 with persistent symptoms, medical follow-up is advised to rule out more serious causes and guide treatment."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q2932","reason":"The exact WBC-over-15000 query has produced multiple directly relevant chunks; continue briefly to see whether it yields additional non-duplicate exact-threshold evidence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2932"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1429319552#1_3022856821","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2932","rank":5,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_11_1429319552#1_3022856821\" , \"end_char\": 1269.000000 , \"headings\": \"\\\" I had CBC done today and was told I have a WBC over 15000. What does that mean? \\\" Zocdoc Answers Medical questions & health advice by licensed doctors \\\" I had CBC done today and was told I have a <cover>WBC over 15000. What does that mean? \" Question Answer See a doctor </cover>who can help Need more info? \" , \"segment\": \"What does that mean? Question I went to Dr first time last Friday for what I thought was a flu. I have headaches, diarrhea, fatigue, very sore joins and hot fashes along with a fever. I was tod I had fluid behind ears and glands in neck were swollen. I was prescribed nasal spray and zpack. I take nasal spray as directed and have already finished entire zpack. I went back to Dr today and got blood brawn and found WBC over 15000. I have to go back in a week to get another CBC but I was wondering what this could mean Answer Sorry to "}}
